LAF HANDLE_AUDIO END

COPY_EXISTING ~osprey.cre~ ~override~
  SAY INITIAL_MEETING ~嗯？~ [C0CR2Of]
  SAY MORALE ~我们得快跑！~ [C0CR2Ou_]
  SAY LEADER ~跟我来！~ [C0CR2Ot]
  SAY TIRED ~我得歇会儿，就一小会儿。~ [C0CR2Oc]
  SAY BORED ~希望我们马上就能有事做吧？~ [C0CR2Od]
  SAY BATTLE_CRY1 ~胜利必将属于我！~ [C0CR2Og_]
  SAY DAMAGE ~呃啊！~ [C0CR2Ol]
  SAY DYING ~呃啊……啊……~ [C0CR2Om]
  SAY HURT ~我需要治疗！~ [C0CR2Oe]
  SAY SELECT_COMMON1 ~嗯？~ [C0CR2Of]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION1 ~好的。~ [C0CR2Oi]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION2 ~结束了。~ [C0CR2Oj]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION3 ~没错。~ [C0CR2Ok]
  SAY CRITICAL_HIT ~吃我一击！~ [C0CR2O8]
  SAY CRITICAL_MISS ~该死！~ [C0CR2O1]
  SAY TARGET_IMMUNE ~我的武器毫无作用！~ [C0CR2O2]
  SAY INVENTORY_FULL ~够了！我拿不动了。~ [C0CR2O3]
  SAY SPELL_DISRUPTED ~我的法术被打断了！~ [C0CR2O6]
  SAY HIDDEN_IN_SHADOWS ~如影随形。~ [C0CR2O5]
  
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/cre/C0CR2OS.cre~ ~override~
  SAY NAME1 ~奥斯普蕾~
  SAY NAME2 ~奥斯普蕾~
  WRITE_ASCII 0x248 ~C0CR2OS~ #8  //override script
  WRITE_ASCII 0x280 ~C0CR2OS~ #32  //DV
  WRITE_ASCII 0x2cc ~C0CR2OS~ #8   //pre-joining dialogue file
  SAY BIO ~奥斯普蕾是一名见习抄写员，也是你与爱蒙的童年好友。她是学者与知识之神迪奈尔的虔诚信徒——甚至可以说有些过于虔诚，在烛堡这样的地方，再没有比她更适配这里的人了。奥斯普蕾兼修奥术与神术，求知若渴，热爱各类学问。

在你的记忆里，奥斯普蕾是烛堡一位年迈抄写员的女儿，和你与爱蒙一样，她人生的大部分时光都在城堡的高墙内度过。作为一名虔诚的迪奈尔信徒，她是泰瑟托尔最赏识的学生之一，潜心钻研文学、历史与魔法知识。也正因此，奥斯普蕾对奥术有着极为深厚的学术理解，她将知识视为凡人所能获得的至高恩赐。尽管她时常笨手笨脚，还总爱说教，但性情温和，认为用自己的能力帮助有需要的人是她的职责。

你上次见到奥斯普蕾时，她正随迪奈尔的著名牧师卡德利·博纳杜斯离开烛堡，前往翔灵修道院随其修行。但当剑湾战事将至、圣战爆发的消息传到翔灵修道院后，奥斯普蕾得到了卡德利的祝福，启程返乡，加入炎骑士团以守护故土。~
  SAY INITIAL_MEETING ~嗯？~ [C0CR2Of]
  SAY MORALE ~我们得快跑！~ [C0CR2Ou_]
  SAY LEADER ~跟我来！~ [C0CR2Ot]
  SAY TIRED ~我得歇会儿，就一小会儿。~ [C0CR2Oc]
  SAY BORED ~希望我们马上就能有事做吧？~ [C0CR2Od]
  SAY BATTLE_CRY1 ~小心！~ [C0CR2Oa]
  SAY BATTLE_CRY2 ~你不堪一击，什么都不是！~ [C0CR2Oh_]
  SAY BATTLE_CRY3 ~为了荣耀！~ [C0CR2O9]
  SAY BATTLE_CRY4 ~胜利必将属于我！~ [C0CR2Og_]
  SAY DAMAGE ~呃啊！~ [C0CR2Ol]
  SAY DYING ~呃啊……啊……~ [C0CR2Om]
  SAY HURT ~我需要治疗！~ [C0CR2Oe]
  SAY SELECT_COMMON1 ~嗯？~ [C0CR2Of]
  SAY SELECT_COMMON2 ~幸会。~ [C0CR2Og]
  SAY SELECT_COMMON3 ~我会留意的。~ [C0CR2Ov]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION1 ~好的。~ [C0CR2Oi]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION2 ~结束了。~ [C0CR2Oj]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION3 ~没错。~ [C0CR2Ok]
  SAY SELECT_ACTION4 ~我去看看。~ [C0CR2Ou]
  SAY CRITICAL_HIT ~吃我一击！~ [C0CR2O8]
  SAY CRITICAL_MISS ~该死！~ [C0CR2O1]
  SAY TARGET_IMMUNE ~我的武器毫无作用！~ [C0CR2O2]
  SAY INVENTORY_FULL ~够了！我拿不动了。~ [C0CR2O3]
  SAY SPELL_DISRUPTED ~我的法术被打断了！~ [C0CR2O6]
  SAY HIDDEN_IN_SHADOWS ~如影随形。~ [C0CR2O5]
    ADD_KNOWN_SPELL ~C0CR#OSS~ #0 ~INNATE~
    ADD_MEMORIZED_SPELL ~C0CR#OSS~ #0 ~INNATE~ (1)

ACTION_IF FILE_EXISTS_IN_GAME ~C0CR#OSP.BMP~ THEN BEGIN
COPY_EXISTING ~C0CR2OS.cre~ ~override~
  WRITE_ASCII 0x34 ~C0CR#OSP~ #8   //small portrait
  WRITE_ASCII 0x3C ~C0CR#OSP~ #8   //medium portrait
  END

COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/itm/SOD/C0CR2LE.ITM~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME2 ~抄写员皮甲~
SAY DESC ~与普遍误解不同，皮甲并非像游侠靴子或德鲁伊长袍所用的皮革那般柔软柔韧。那种皮革的防护力与普通衣物别无二致。这套蓝灰色的护甲带有大抄写员迪奈尔的信徒所常用的配色与徽记。

属性：

装备效果：
– 不影响施法
– 法术豁免：+2

护甲等级：7（对抗穿刺与远程攻击时为9）
需求：
 力量 4
 
重量：10~

COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/itm/SOD/C0CR2HA.EFF~ ~OVERRIDE~
COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/itm/SOD/C0CR2HA.ITM~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME2 ~正义之锤~
SAY DESC ~那位只被称作「律法」的战士热忱而善良，他打造了这套魔法武器用以武装律法与秩序之力，由此声名远扬。每一把武器都灌注着他根除混乱的炽烈意志，也因此成为了维护秩序的强力武器。

属性：

零级命中值：+1，对抗混乱阵营时+3
伤害：1d4+2，对抗混乱阵营时+4
伤害类型：粉碎
速度因子：3
擅长类型：战锤
类型：单手
需求：
 力量 9
 
重量：6~

COPY ~%MOD_FOLDER%/itm/SOD/C0CR2RI.ITM~ ~OVERRIDE~
SAY NAME2 ~神学之戒~
SAY DESC ~神学之戒
这枚戒指印有宏识图书馆的印记——那曾是一座备受尊崇的知识圣地。侍奉迪奈尔教会、专攻神祇与神术研究的学者们佩戴它，作为自身研究领域的象征，其中许多人至少在理论层面通晓奥术。尽管宏识图书馆已在黑暗势力的阴谋中被毁，卡德利·博纳杜斯在其原址上建立了翔灵修道院，保存了大量知识与遗物，这枚戒指便是其中之一。

属性：

装备效果：
– 可额外记忆1个1环与1个2环法师法术，以及1个1环与1个2环牧师法术。

重量：0~

APPEND ~bddialog.2da~
~C0CR2OS        C0CR2OS	C0CR2OSJ	C0CR2OSD~
UNLESS ~C0CR2OS~

ACTION_FOR_EACH scripts IN BD0020 BD0063 BD0103 BD1000 BD2000 BD3000 BD4100 BD4300 BD4400 BD5300 BD7100 BDASC3 BDC116D BDCUT08 BDCUT58 BDCUT59B BDCUT61 BDPARTY BEGIN
EXTEND_TOP ~%scripts%.BCS~ ~%MOD_FOLDER%/bcs/SOD/%scripts%.BAF~ EVAL
END

ACTION_FOR_EACH new_bcs IN C0CR2OS C0CR2OSB C02OSCV1 BEGIN
COMPILE EVALUATE_BUFFER ~%MOD_FOLDER%/bcs/SOD/%new_bcs%.baf~
END

ACTION_FOR_EACH new_dlg IN C0CR2OS C0CR2OSJ BEGIN
COMPILE EVALUATE_BUFFER ~%MOD_FOLDER%/dlg/SOD/%new_dlg%.d~
END

ACTION_IF GAME_IS ~eet~ BEGIN
  INCLUDE ~EET/other/EET_functions.tph~ //this function will be in the player's own EET folder
  LAF ~EET_NPC_TRANSITION~ 
    INT_VAR
      type = 1 //Biff is only available in BG:EE/SoD. Adapt this if needed; including the additional STR_VARs
    STR_VAR
      dv = "C0CR2OS" //Biff's scriptname (death variable)
      override_SoD = "C0CR2OS" //OVERRIDE script in SoD. This will add a "DestroySelf()" in Chapter greater than 13 to the SoD script.
      traFile = "%MOD_FOLDER%/tra/%LANGUAGE%/GAME-C0CR2OS.tra" //path to the text line for the ToB Fate Spirit summoning
      string = "@0" /* ~Bring me Biff the Understudy.~ */ //from the above specified tra file
      stringPosDV = "Neera" //Name after which Biff's should be put into the order of reply options at the fate spirit summoning dialogue. 
/* From the "Modder's Notes for Baldur's Gate: Enhanced Edition Trilogy (EET)":
      //Aerie, Ajantis, Alora, Anomen, Baeloth, Branwen, Cernd, Coran, Corwin, Dorn, Dynaheir, Edwin, Eldoth, Faldorn, Garrick,
      //Glint, HaerDalis, Hexxat, Imoen2, Jaheira, Jan, Kagain, Keldorn, Khalid, Kivan, Korgan, MKhiin, Mazzy, Minsc, Montaron,
      //Nalia, Neera, Quayle, Rasaad, Safana, SharTeel, Skie, Tiax, Valygar, Viconia, Voghiln, Wilson, Xan, Xzar, Yeslick, Yoshimo
      //variable not set (default) = NPC name appended at the end of summoning list */
  END
END
